config.buzzybeesbackport.compat.duplicates=Duplicate Blocks
config.buzzybeesbackport.compat.duplicates.tooltip=When another installed mod adds the same blocks and items: OURS hides theirs, THEIRS hides ours, BOTH hides nothing.
config.buzzybeesbackport.campfire=Campfire
config.buzzybeesbackport.campfire.tooltip=The campfire, when Village & Pillage Backport is not installed.
config.buzzybeesbackport.campfire.enabled=Enabled
config.buzzybeesbackport.campfire.enabled.tooltip=Whether this mod adds its copy of the campfire when Village & Pillage Backport is not installed. With it installed, its campfire is used and this does nothing.
config.buzzybeesbackport.campfire.cookTime=Cooking Time
config.buzzybeesbackport.campfire.cookTime.tooltip=How long one item takes to cook, in ticks. 1.14's is 600 (30 seconds), three times a furnace.
config.buzzybeesbackport.campfire.extraFoods=Extra Foods
config.buzzybeesbackport.campfire.extraFoods.tooltip=What the campfire cooks. By default: every furnace recipe whose input and output are both food, which is 1.14's own list (raw meat, raw fish, potatoes) plus any mod's raw foods. Add an item the default leaves out as 'modid:item' (cooked as the furnace would) or 'modid:item=modid:result' (cooked into that). Add ':meta' after either to pick one variant, e.g. 'minecraft:fish:1=minecraft:cooked_fish:1'.
config.buzzybeesbackport.campfire.excludedFoods=Excluded Foods
config.buzzybeesbackport.campfire.excludedFoods.tooltip=Items the campfire refuses, even though the rule above would cook them, as 'modid:item' or 'modid:item:meta'.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.craftingShiftClick=Shift-Click into the Crafting Grid
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.craftingShiftClick.tooltip=At a crafting table, shift-clicking a stack in your inventory moves it into the crafting grid, and only to the other part of the inventory when the grid has no room.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.elytraJump=Open Elytra While Rising
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.elytraJump.tooltip=Elytra can be opened right after a jump, while you are still rising.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.toggleSneak=Toggle Sneak
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.toggleSneak.tooltip=Client: the sneak key turns sneaking on and off instead of being held.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.toggleSprint=Toggle Sprint
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.toggleSprint.tooltip=Client: the sprint key turns sprinting on and off instead of being held.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.dispensedFireworks=Dispensed Fireworks Fly Forward
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.dispensedFireworks.tooltip=A firework rocket fired from a dispenser flies straight the way the dispenser faces.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.advancementBees=Bees in Husbandry Advancements
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.advancementBees.tooltip=Two by Two also needs bees bred, and A Balanced Diet also needs a honey bottle.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.parrotsWhileRiding=Parrots Stay on Shoulders
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.parrotsWhileRiding.tooltip=Parrots stay on your shoulders while you ride a horse, boat, minecart or anything else.
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.xpWithLoot=Experience Drops With Loot
config.buzzybeesbackport.tweaks.xpWithLoot.tooltip=A dying mob or player drops its experience at once, with its loot, instead of after the death animation.
